  <text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
    <body>

        <div xml:id="AN230.1-kilavi">
          <p type="edition">1. talaimakaḷaik kaṇṇuṟṟu nīṅkun talaimakaṉ ṟaṉṉeñciṟkuc colliyatu. 2. pāṅkaṟkuc colliyatūumām.</p>
          <p type="translation" xml:lang="en">1. What HE, who left after having seen HER, said to his heart. 2. (C2+9v:) It is also what [HE] said to [his] companion.</p>
        </div>
        <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="AN230.1">
        <l>uṟukaḻi maruṅki ṉōtamoṭu malarnta</l>
        <l>ciṟukaru neytaṟ kaṇpōṉ māmalar</l>
        <l>peruntaṇ māttaḻai <supplied>yi</supplied>runta valku</l>
        <l>laiya varumpiya cuṇaṅkiṉ vaiyeyiṟṟu</l>
        <l>maiyī rōti vāṇutaṟ kuṟumakaḷ</l>
        <l>viḷaiyāṭ ṭāyamoṭu veṇmaṇa lutirtta</l>
        <l>puṉṉai nuṇṭātu poṉṉi ṉoṇṭu </l>
        <l>maṉaipuṟan taruti yāyi ṉeṉaiyatūu</l>
        <l>mammaṉaik kiḻamai yemmoṭu puṇariṟ</l>
        <l>ṟītu muṇṭō māta rāyeṉak</l>
        <l>kaṭumpari naṉmāṉ koṭuñci neṭuntēr</l>
        <l>kaival pākaṉ paiyeṉa viyakka</l>
        <l>yāntaṟ kuṟukiṉa māka vēnteḻi</l>
        <l>larivē yuṇkaṭ paṉivara loṭukkic</l>
        <l>ciṟiya viṟaiñciṉa ṭalaiyē</l>
        <l>periya vevva<supplied>m</supplied> yāmiva ṇuṟavē.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg type="translation" xml:lang="en">
        <l corresp="5">The little girl with bright forehead, kajal[-dark] moist hair,</l>
        <l corresp="4">sharp teeth [and] with beauty spots that have budded wonderfully</l>
        <l corresp="3">on [her] hip on which were big cool dark foliage</l>
        <l corresp="2">[and] eye-like large blossoms of the small dark blue waterlily</l>
        <l corresp="1">that bloomed with the flood by the side of the swelling(?)  backwaters,</l>
        <l corresp="15">she bowed [her] head a little,</l>
        <l corresp="14">holding back the coming of tears from [her] kajal eyes filled with red streaks,</l>
        <l corresp="13">eminently graceful, when we came near her,</l>
        <l>while [our] dexterous charioteer let the tall chariot</l>
        <l corresp="11f">with a [support] staff [and] fast-moving good horses go gently,</l>
        <l corresp="10d" rend="indent8">saying:</l>
        <l corresp="8a-c">“since you can take care of the house,</l>
        <l corresp="7">measuring it out(?) with the gold of the fine pollen from the Puṉṉai tree</l>
        <l corresp="6">that [you] shook down into the white sand, in play with [your] companions,</l>
        <l corresp="9">if you joined with us in mastering this house,</l>
        <l corresp="10">would there be anything wrong, you beautiful one?”,</l>
        <l corresp="16">- so that we had great distress here.</l>
      </lg>
        </div>
    </body>
  </text>

